# fixture: aca-over-the-cliff  (adversarial)
#
# the 400% cliff with an advance outstanding. 2027 is advanced on 2026's
# income, then an old 401(k) closes in June and its whole balance is
# ordinary income, so 2027 is over the cliff: no credit at all, and every
# dollar advanced is repaid, with no cap. 2028 renews on 2027, which is over
# the cliff, so nothing is advanced, and the whole 2028 credit comes back on
# the return. The card has no finish date, so it ends in December 2029,
# before the household turns 65 and Medicare takes over: 2030 has no
# coverage and no credit.

